#. Description of the plugin
#: diluxone-users.php
msgid ""
"Custom user fields, a front-end account area, passwordless sign-in, social "
"login, two-step verification, passkeys and session control."
msgstr ""
"Campos de usuario propios, un área de cuenta en el sitio, acceso sin "
"contraseña, login social, verificación en dos pasos, passkeys y control de "
"sesiones."

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:98
msgid ""
"Leave it on “None” unless this site really is behind a proxy: a header "
"nobody is writing is a header the visitor can write. When there is one, pick "
"the one it writes — X-Forwarded-For for nginx, Traefik and most load "
"balancers, CF-Connecting-IP behind Cloudflare, True-Client-IP behind Akamai."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo en «Ninguna» salvo que este sitio esté realmente detrás de un proxy: "
"una cabecera que nadie escribe es una cabecera que escribe el visitante. Si "
"hay proxy, elige la que escribe él: X-Forwarded-For para nginx, Traefik y la "
"mayoría de los balanceadores, CF-Connecting-IP detrás de Cloudflare, True-"
"Client-IP detrás de Akamai."

#: includes/admin-social.php:680
msgid ""
"A secret is saved. Leave this empty to keep it, or paste a new one to "
"replace it."
msgstr ""
"Hay un secreto guardado. Deja esto vacío para conservarlo, o pega uno nuevo "
"para reemplazarlo."

#: includes/admin-tools.php:448
msgid "That file is too big to be a settings export."
msgstr "Ese archivo es demasiado grande para ser una exportación de ajustes."

#: includes/admin-tools.php:619 includes/admin-tools.php:631
msgid "What happens when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr "Qué pasa cuando se borra el plugin"

#: includes/admin-tools.php:632
msgid ""
"By default, nothing. The settings stay, the activity log stays, and so does "
"everything in people’s profiles — their details, their public names, their "
"passkeys and their second factors. That is on purpose: a plugin deleted by "
"accident, or deleted to be installed again, should not be what loses "
"somebody their account. Tick this only when the plugin is going for good and "
"the data is meant to go with it. It cannot be undone, and it runs on delete, "
"not on deactivate."
msgstr ""
"Por omisión, nada. Quedan los ajustes, queda el registro de actividad y "
"queda todo lo que hay en los perfiles: los datos de cada persona, sus "
"nombres públicos, sus passkeys y sus segundos factores. Es a propósito: un "
"plugin borrado por error, o borrado para volver a instalarlo, no tiene que "
"ser lo que le haga perder la cuenta a alguien. Marca esto solo si el plugin "
"se va para siempre y los datos se van con él. No se puede deshacer, y se "
"ejecuta al borrar, no al desactivar."

#: includes/admin-network.php:552 includes/admin-tools.php:638
msgid "Remove everything this plugin wrote when it is deleted"
msgstr "Borrar todo lo que escribió este plugin cuando se elimine"

#: includes/admin-tools.php:696
msgid "Deleting the plugin will now remove everything it wrote."
msgstr "A partir de ahora, borrar el plugin eliminará todo lo que escribió."

#: includes/admin-tools.php:697
msgid "Deleting the plugin will leave the data where it is."
msgstr "Borrar el plugin dejará los datos donde están."

#: includes/auth-passkeys.php:483
msgid "Too many attempts. Wait a moment and try again."
msgstr "Demasiados intentos. Espera un momento y vuelve a intentarlo."

#: includes/client-ip.php:36
msgid "None — read the connection"
msgstr "Ninguna — leer la conexión"

#: includes/log.php:528
msgid "Second step refused"
msgstr "Segundo paso rechazado"

#: includes/login-messages.php:179
msgid "Too many wrong codes"
msgstr "Demasiados códigos equivocados"

#: includes/login-messages.php:180
msgid ""
"Shown once an account has answered the second step wrongly too many times. "
"The wait grows with every further try and the account opens again on its own."
msgstr ""
"Se muestra cuando una cuenta ha fallado el segundo paso demasiadas veces. La "
"espera crece con cada intento nuevo y la cuenta se vuelve a abrir sola."

#: includes/login-messages.php:182
msgid "Too many wrong codes. Wait a few minutes and try again."
msgstr ""
"Demasiados códigos equivocados. Espera unos minutos y vuelve a intentarlo."

#: includes/privacy.php:37 includes/privacy.php:276
