msgstr "Cómo accedes"

#: includes/privacy.php:99
msgid "Added"
msgstr "Añadida"

#: includes/privacy.php:103
msgid "Last used"
msgstr "Último uso"

#: includes/privacy.php:180
msgid "Profile picture"
msgstr "Foto de perfil"

#: includes/privacy.php:194
msgid "No"
msgstr "No"

#: includes/privacy.php:216
msgid "Linked account"
msgstr "Cuenta vinculada"

#: includes/privacy.php:231
msgid "Set up"
msgstr "Configurada"

#: includes/privacy.php:256
msgid "Devices recognised"
msgstr "Dispositivos reconocidos"

#: includes/privacy.php:409
msgid "This site uses DiluxOne Users+ to hold accounts and sign people in."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio usa DiluxOne Users+ para guardar las cuentas y dar acceso a las "
"personas."

#: includes/privacy.php:410
msgid "What is stored in your profile"
msgstr "Qué se guarda en tu perfil"

#: includes/privacy.php:411
msgid ""
"the answers to the fields this site asks for, your public name, your profile "
"picture, which social accounts you have linked, your passkeys, whether two-"
"step verification is on, and a hash of each browser you have signed in from "
"so that a new one can be announced once."
msgstr ""
"las respuestas a los campos que pide este sitio, tu nombre público, tu foto "
"de perfil, qué cuentas sociales tienes vinculadas, tus passkeys, si la "
"verificación en dos pasos está activa, y un hash de cada navegador desde el "
"que has accedido, para poder avisarte una sola vez cuando aparece uno nuevo."

#: includes/privacy.php:412
msgid "What is stored in the activity log"
msgstr "Qué se guarda en el registro de actividad"

#: includes/login-messages.php:463
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "Mensajes"

#: includes/login-messages.php:532
msgid "The sentence"
msgstr "La frase"

#: includes/admin-social.php:486
msgid "Who can sign in with a network"
msgstr "Quién puede entrar con una red"

#: includes/admin-social.php:487
msgid ""
"Everybody, or only the roles you pick. Whoever is left out signs in with the "
"email link as always, so nobody is shut out of the site — and it is the "
"account with the most power that is worth thinking about: an administrator "
"who signs in with Google depends on that Google account never being taken "
"over."
msgstr ""
"Todos, o sólo los roles que elijas. Quien quede fuera entra con el enlace "
"por correo como siempre, así que nadie se queda sin entrar al sitio — y la "
"cuenta que conviene pensar es la que más poder tiene: un administrador que "
"entra con Google depende de que esa cuenta de Google nunca se la quede otro."

#: includes/admin-social.php:501
msgid "Who it reaches"
msgstr "A quiénes alcanza"

#: includes/pages.php:111
msgid "Create the page"
msgstr "Crear la página"

#: includes/pages.php:31
msgid "My account"
msgstr "Mi cuenta"

#. translators: %s: the title of the page, linked to it
#: includes/pages.php:170
#, php-format
msgid "The page %s was created and chosen."
msgstr "Se creó la página %s y quedó elegida."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1019
msgid ""
"The account area appears on this page, below whatever the page already says."
msgstr ""
"El área de cuenta aparece en esta página, debajo de lo que la página ya diga."

#: includes/admin-account.php:263
msgid "In the site menu"
msgstr "En el menú del sitio"

#: includes/admin-account.php:316
msgid ""
"A door in the site’s own menu: “Sign in” for visitors, and for whoever is "
"signed in their photo or their name, with their account, the dashboard if "
"they can use it, and a way out underneath. The theme draws it like the rest "
"of the menu."
msgstr ""
"Una puerta en el propio menú del sitio: «Entrar» para quien visita, y para "
"quien entró, su foto o su nombre, con su cuenta, el escritorio si lo puede "
"usar y una forma de salir debajo. El tema lo dibuja como el resto del menú."

#: includes/admin-account.php:320
msgid "Which menu"
msgstr "Qué menú"

#: includes/admin-account.php:324
msgid ""
"It goes at the end of the menu assigned to that place, wherever the theme "
"shows it — the mobile menu included when it is the same menu."
msgstr ""
"Va al final del menú asignado a ese lugar, donde sea que el tema lo muestre; "
"también en el menú del celular cuando es el mismo menú."

#: includes/admin-account.php:330
msgid "How the person looks"
msgstr "Cómo se ve la persona"

#: includes/admin-account.php:342
msgid "The person in the menu"
msgstr "La persona en el menú"

#: includes/admin-account.php:345
msgid "Not shown in any menu."
msgstr "No aparece en ningún menú."

#: includes/admin-account.php:349
msgid "That place has no menu assigned in Appearance → Menus."
msgstr "Ese lugar no tiene un menú asignado en Apariencia → Menús."

#: includes/site-menu.php:23
msgid "— Nowhere —"
msgstr "— En ninguno —"

#: includes/site-menu.php:33
msgid "Photo and name"
msgstr "Foto y nombre"

#: includes/site-menu.php:34
msgid "Photo only"
msgstr "Solo foto"

#: includes/site-menu.php:35
msgid "Name only"
msgstr "Solo nombre"

#: includes/site-menu.php:147
msgid "Go to the WordPress dashboard"
msgstr "Ir al escritorio de WordPress"

#: includes/site-menu.php:149
msgid "Sign out"
msgstr "Salir"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:631
msgid ""
"Your theme publishes no palette, so the plugin takes the colours your theme "
"paints: the colour of its links and buttons, of its text, its page ground "
"and the edge of its fields, measured on the site itself. There is nothing "
"else to choose."
msgstr ""
"Tu tema no publica paleta, así que el plugin toma los colores que tu tema "
"pinta: el de sus enlaces y botones, el de su texto, el fondo de la página y "
"el borde de sus campos, medidos en el propio sitio. No hay nada más que "
"elegir."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:632
msgid ""
"The plugin paints itself with the palette your theme publishes, and goes on "
"following it — into the theme’s own dark mode as well, where it hands over a "
"variable rather than a colour. Any part the palette does not name is taken "
"from what your theme paints on the site. There is nothing else to choose."
msgstr ""
"El plugin se pinta con la paleta que publica tu tema y la sigue — también en "
"el modo oscuro del tema, donde pasa una variable en lugar de un color. Lo "
"que la paleta no nombra se toma de lo que tu tema pinta en el sitio. No hay "
"nada más que elegir."

#: includes/admin-new-user.php:68
msgid "The username is the e-mail address, as for every account on this site."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de usuario es el correo electrónico, como en todas las cuentas de "
"este sitio."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1022
msgid ""
"With plain permalinks the sections go as ?section=…; turn on pretty "
"permalinks in Settings → Permalinks and they become /page/section/ on their "
"own."
msgstr ""
"Con enlaces permanentes simples las secciones van como ?section=…; activa "
"los enlaces permanentes amigables en Ajustes → Enlaces permanentes y se "
"vuelven /pagina/seccion/ solas."

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:257
msgid "Their sessions are closed: they are signed out everywhere."
msgstr "Sus sesiones están cerradas: quedó fuera en todos lados."

#. translators: %d: the largest side allowed, in pixels
#: includes/avatar.php:353
#, php-format
msgid "The photo is too large: at most %d pixels a side."
msgstr "La foto es demasiado grande: como máximo %d píxeles por lado."

#: includes/fields-forms.php:406
msgid "Error: the form expired. Load the page again and send it once more."
msgstr ""
"Error: el formulario expiró. Carga la página de nuevo y envíalo otra vez."

#. translators: %d: how many refused sign-in attempts are kept.
#: includes/log-privacy.php:181
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d refused sign-in attempt that typed this person's username or e-mail was "
"kept: it is security evidence, and it is deleted when the activity log's "
"retention runs out."
msgid_plural ""
"%d refused sign-in attempts that typed this person's username or e-mail were "
"kept: they are security evidence, and they are deleted when the activity "
"log's retention runs out."
msgstr[0] ""
"Se conservó %d intento de acceso rechazado que escribió el usuario o el "
"correo de esta persona: es evidencia de seguridad, y se borra cuando vence "
"la retención del registro de actividad."
msgstr[1] ""
"Se conservaron %d intentos de acceso rechazados que escribieron el usuario o "
"el correo de esta persona: son evidencia de seguridad, y se borran cuando "
"vence la retención del registro de actividad."

#: includes/login-ways.php:591
msgid "Email address or public name"
msgstr "Correo electrónico o nombre público"

#: includes/privacy.php:413
msgid ""
"for each recorded event: the date, the account, your IP address and your "
"browser’s user-agent string. When a sign-in is refused, what was typed in "
"the username box is kept with it, because that is how an attempt to guess an "
"account is recognised. Which events are recorded, and for how many days, are "
"settings of this site."
msgstr ""
"de cada evento registrado: la fecha, la cuenta, tu dirección IP y el user-"
"agent de tu navegador. Cuando se rechaza un acceso, se guarda con él lo que "
"se escribió en el campo de usuario, porque así se reconoce un intento de "
"adivinar una cuenta. Qué eventos se registran, y por cuántos días, son "
"ajustes de este sitio."

#: includes/privacy.php:414
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookies"

#: includes/privacy.php:419
msgid ""
"the plugin sends nothing anywhere on its own. If this site offers social "
"sign-in, the provider you choose receives what it needs to identify you, and "
"only when you use it; the account id it answers with is kept in your profile "
"so it can recognise you next time. If your profile has no picture of its own "
"and this site shows Gravatar pictures, your browser asks Gravatar (gravatar."
"com) for one using a hash of your e-mail address."
msgstr ""
"el plugin no envía nada a ningún lado por su cuenta. Si este sitio ofrece "
"acceso con redes sociales, el proveedor que elijas recibe lo que necesita "
"para identificarte, y solo cuando lo usas; el identificador de cuenta con el "
"que responde se guarda en tu perfil para reconocerte la próxima vez. Si tu "
"perfil no tiene foto propia y este sitio muestra fotos de Gravatar, tu "
"navegador le pide una a Gravatar (gravatar.com) usando un hash de tu correo."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:126
msgid ""
"A file with everything this site keeps about you: your details, and what the "
"site and its plugins record about you. You get an email to confirm; once you "
"do, we prepare it and it shows up here to download."
msgstr ""
"Un archivo con todo lo que este sitio guarda sobre ti: tus datos, y lo que "
"el sitio y sus plugins registran sobre ti. Te llega un correo para "
"confirmar; cuando confirmas, lo preparamos y aparece aquí para descargar."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:65
msgid ""
"What this site keeps about you is erased: your details, and what the site "
"and its plugins record about you."
msgstr ""
"Se borra lo que este sitio guarda sobre ti: tus datos, y lo que el sitio y "
"sus plugins registran sobre ti."

#: templates/accounts.php:27
msgid ""
"That social account already opens another account on this site, so it was "
"not linked to this one."
msgstr ""
"Esa cuenta de red social ya abre otra cuenta en este sitio, así que no se "
"vinculó a esta."

#: templates/register.php:41
msgid "Sign in to create your account"
msgstr "Entra para crear tu cuenta"

#: templates/register.php:42
msgid ""
"There is no form to fill in: sign in with your e-mail and the account is "
"created the first time."
msgstr ""
"No hay formulario que llenar: entra con tu correo y la cuenta se crea la "
"primera vez."

#: includes/account-closing.php:113
msgid "Deleted account"
msgstr "Cuenta eliminada"

#: includes/account-closing.php:324
msgid "This account was closed."
msgstr "Esta cuenta se cerró."

#: includes/admin-account.php:979
msgid "can ask to be deleted"
msgstr "puede pedir que se borre su cuenta"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1539
msgid "They can ask for their account to be deleted"
msgstr "Puede pedir que le borren la cuenta"

#: includes/privacy.php:416
msgid "Deleting your account"
msgstr "Borrar tu cuenta"

#: templates/account/privacy.php:152
msgid "Delete your account"
msgstr "Borrar tu cuenta"

#: templates/account/privacy.php:156
msgid ""
"This account administers the site, so it cannot delete itself: the site "
"would be left with nobody in charge. Another administrator has to lower its "
"role first, and then it can ask."
msgstr ""
"Esta cuenta administra el sitio, así que no puede borrarse sola: el sitio se "
"quedaría sin nadie a cargo. Primero otro administrador tiene que bajarle el "
"rol, y después sí puede pedirlo."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:67
msgid ""
"Your account is closed: deleted if you have nothing published here, or left "
"with no name, e-mail or password if you do."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta se cierra: se elimina si no tienes nada publicado aquí, o queda "
"sin nombre, correo ni contraseña si lo tienes."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:68
msgid ""
"You stop being able to sign in, and nothing can be recovered afterwards — "
"not by you and not by us."
msgstr ""
"Dejas de poder entrar, y después no se recupera nada — ni tú ni nosotros."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:187
msgid "Ask to delete my account"
msgstr "Pedir que borren mi cuenta"

#: includes/account-closing.php:309
msgid "Done: your data has been erased and your account closed."
msgstr "Listo: tus datos se borraron y tu cuenta se cerró."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1540
msgid ""
"They confirm it by e-mail. Their data is erased and the account deleted, or "
"left with no name, e-mail or password if they published something. Never for "
"an account that administers the site."
msgstr ""
"La confirman por correo. Sus datos se borran y la cuenta se elimina, o queda "
"sin nombre, correo ni contraseña si publicó algo. Nunca para una cuenta que "
"administra el sitio."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1509 includes/admin-account.php:1546
msgid "As soon as they confirm it"
msgstr "En cuanto lo confirman"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1547
msgid "When you carry it out"
msgstr "Cuando tú lo ejecutas"

#: includes/privacy.php:417
msgid ""
"you can ask for it from your account; once you confirm it by e-mail and the "
"site carries it out, your data is erased and the account deleted, or, if you "
"published something here or belong to another site of the network, left with "
"no name, e-mail or password so what you wrote stays without your name."
msgstr ""
"puedes pedirlo desde tu cuenta; cuando lo confirmas por correo y el sitio lo "
"ejecuta, tus datos se borran y la cuenta se elimina, o, si publicaste algo "
"aquí o perteneces a otro sitio de la red, queda sin nombre, correo ni "
"contraseña para que lo que escribiste quede sin tu nombre."

#: includes/account-export.php:185
msgid ""
"Done: your file is ready. We have e-mailed you the link, and you can also "
"download it from your account."
msgstr ""
"Listo: tu archivo está preparado. Te enviamos el enlace por correo y también "
"puedes descargarlo desde tu cuenta."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1503
msgid ""
"The export WordPress already knows how to make: they confirm it by e-mail "
"and get a file with everything the site keeps about them."
msgstr ""
"La exportación que WordPress ya sabe hacer: la confirman por correo y "
"reciben un archivo con todo lo que el sitio guarda sobre ellos."

#: includes/account-export.php:206
msgid "This file is not yours to download."
msgstr "Este archivo no es tuyo: no puedes descargarlo."

#: includes/account-export.php:212
msgid "This file is no longer there. Ask for your data again."
msgstr "Este archivo ya no está. Vuelve a solicitar tus datos."

#: includes/account-export.php:217
msgid "my-data"
msgstr "mis-datos"

#: includes/account-mail.php:34
msgid ""
"Only for requests made from the account area; those filed from Tools keep "
"WordPress’s own words."
msgstr ""
"Solo para las solicitudes hechas desde el área de cuenta; las que se crean "
"desde Herramientas conservan las palabras de WordPress."

#: includes/account-mail.php:37
msgid "Confirming a copy of their data"
msgstr "Confirmar una copia de sus datos"

#: includes/account-mail.php:38
msgid "Sent when somebody asks for a copy of their data from their account."
msgstr "Se envía cuando alguien pide una copia de sus datos desde su cuenta."

#: includes/account-mail.php:40 includes/account-mail.php:61
msgid "the address that confirms it — the e-mail is useless without it"
msgstr "la dirección que lo confirma — sin ella el correo no sirve"

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/account-mail.php:49
#, php-format
msgid "Confirm your copy of your data on %s"
msgstr "Confirma la copia de tus datos en %s"

#: includes/account-mail.php:52
msgid ""
"You asked for a copy of everything this site keeps about you. To confirm it, "
"open this link:\n"
"\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"If you did not ask for it, ignore this message: nothing happens without it."
msgstr ""
"Pediste una copia de todo lo que este sitio guarda sobre ti. Para "
"confirmarlo, abre este enlace:\n"
"\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"Si no lo pediste, ignora este mensaje: sin él no pasa nada."

#: includes/account-mail.php:58
msgid "Confirming the deletion of their account"
msgstr "Confirmar el borrado de su cuenta"

#: includes/account-mail.php:59
msgid ""
"Sent when somebody asks from their account for the account to be deleted."
msgstr "Se envía cuando alguien pide desde su cuenta que se borre."

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/account-mail.php:70
#, php-format
msgid "Confirm the deletion of your account on %s"
msgstr "Confirma el borrado de tu cuenta en %s"

#: includes/account-mail.php:73
msgid ""
"You asked for your account to be deleted. To go ahead, open this link:\n"
"\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"If you did not ask for it, ignore this message: nothing is deleted without "
"it. Somebody used your account, so change your password."
msgstr ""
"Pediste que se borre tu cuenta. Para continuar, abre este enlace:\n"
"\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"Si no lo pediste, ignora este mensaje: sin él no se borra nada. Alguien usó "
"tu cuenta, así que cambia tu contraseña."

#: includes/account-mail.php:79
msgid "Their copy is ready"
msgstr "Su copia está lista"

#: includes/account-mail.php:80
msgid "Sent when the file with their data has been made."
msgstr "Se envía cuando el archivo con sus datos ya está hecho."

#: includes/account-mail.php:82
msgid ""
"where to download it: their account, or the file itself if the site mails "
"the link — the e-mail is useless without it"
msgstr ""
"dónde descargarlo: su cuenta, o el propio archivo si el sitio envía el "
"enlace por correo — sin eso el correo no sirve"

#: includes/account-mail.php:83
msgid "the date the file is deleted"
msgstr "la fecha en que se borra el archivo"

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/account-mail.php:92
#, php-format
msgid "Your data from %s is ready"
msgstr "Tus datos de %s están listos"

#: includes/account-mail.php:95
msgid ""
"The file with everything this site keeps about you is ready. Download it "
"here:\n"
"\n"
"{download}\n"
"\n"
"It is deleted on {until}, so download it before then."
msgstr ""
"El archivo con todo lo que este sitio guarda sobre ti está listo. Descárgalo "
"aquí:\n"
"\n"
"{download}\n"
"\n"
"Se borra el {until}, así que descárgalo antes."

#: includes/account-mail.php:101
msgid "Their account was deleted"
msgstr "Su cuenta se borró"

#: includes/account-mail.php:102
msgid "Sent when the deletion they asked for has been carried out."
msgstr "Se envía cuando se realizó el borrado que pidió."

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/account-mail.php:112
#, php-format
msgid "Your account on %s was deleted"
msgstr "Tu cuenta en %s se borró"

#: includes/account-mail.php:115
msgid ""
"Your account was deleted, as you asked, and what this site kept about you "
"has been erased.\n"
"\n"
"If you ever want to come back, you can make a new account."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta se borró, como lo pediste, y se eliminó lo que este sitio guardaba "
"sobre ti.\n"
"\n"
"Si algún día quieres volver, puedes crear una cuenta nueva."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1507
msgid "The file is made"
msgstr "El archivo se genera"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1510
msgid "When you make it"
msgstr "Cuando tú lo generas"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1512
msgid "Made by you, it waits in Tools → Export Personal Data."
msgstr "Si lo generas tú, espera en Herramientas → Exportar datos personales."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1516 includes/admin-account.php:1553
msgid "The link in the confirmation e-mail"
msgstr "El enlace del correo de confirmación"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1518
msgid "Asks them to sign in"
msgstr "Les pide entrar"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1519 includes/admin-account.php:1556
msgid "Confirms by itself"
msgstr "Confirma por sí solo"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1521
msgid ""
"Signing in proves the account as well as the e-mail. By itself is how "
"WordPress does it: whoever opens the e-mail confirms."
msgstr ""
"Entrar demuestra la cuenta además del correo. Que confirme por sí solo es lo "
"que hace WordPress: confirma quien abra el correo."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1525
msgid "The file is downloaded"
msgstr "El archivo se descarga"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1527
msgid "From their account"
msgstr "Desde su cuenta"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1528
msgid "From a link in the e-mail"
msgstr "Desde un enlace en el correo"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1530
msgid ""
"From the account, only they can download it, signed in. The link in the e-"
"mail is how WordPress does it: whoever has the link gets the file, with no "
"sign-in, until WordPress deletes it three days later."
msgstr ""
"Desde la cuenta, solo puede descargarlo esa persona, con la sesión iniciada. "
"El enlace en el correo es como lo hace WordPress: quien tenga el enlace se "
"lleva el archivo, sin entrar, hasta que WordPress lo borra tres días después."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1544
msgid "The account is closed"
msgstr "La cuenta se cierra"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1549
msgid ""
"Carried out by you, it waits in Tools → Erase Personal Data: for a site that "
"checks something first, such as a pending payment."
msgstr ""
"Si lo ejecutas tú, espera en Herramientas → Borrar datos personales: para un "
"sitio que primero comprueba algo, como un pago pendiente."

#: includes/admin-account.php:1555
msgid "Asks them to sign in and to be sure"
msgstr "Les pide entrar y estar seguros"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1558
msgid ""
"Signed in, the site shows once more what is lost and deletes nothing until "
"they press the button. By itself is how WordPress does it: opening the e-"
"mail is enough."
msgstr ""
"Con la sesión iniciada, el sitio muestra una vez más lo que se pierde y no "
"borra nada hasta que pulsen el botón. Que confirme por sí solo es lo que "
"hace WordPress: basta con abrir el correo."

#: includes/login-messages.php:119
msgid "Signing in to confirm a request"
msgstr "Entrar para confirmar una solicitud"

#: includes/login-messages.php:120
msgid ""
"Shown to somebody who opened the link that confirms a copy of their data or "
"the deletion of their account, and has to sign in first."
msgstr ""
"Se muestra a quien abrió el enlace que confirma una copia de sus datos o el "
"borrado de su cuenta, y primero tiene que entrar."

#: includes/login-messages.php:122
msgid ""
"Sign in to confirm your request. It has to be the account that asked for it."
msgstr ""
"Entra para confirmar tu solicitud. Tiene que ser la cuenta que la hizo."

#: includes/login-messages.php:129
msgid "The account was deleted"
msgstr "La cuenta se borró"

#: includes/login-messages.php:130
msgid ""
"Shown to somebody who has just confirmed, from their account, that it should "
"be deleted."
msgstr "Se muestra a quien acaba de confirmar, desde su cuenta, que se borre."

#: includes/login-messages.php:132
msgid "Your account was deleted and your data erased."
msgstr "Tu cuenta se borró y tus datos se eliminaron."

#: includes/privacy.php:415
msgid ""
"while you sign in, short-lived cookies hold the progress of the attempt: a "
"social sign-in, a password reset, the address you asked a link for, the "
"request you are signing in to confirm. If you ask not to be asked for the "
"second step again on a browser, a cookie remembers that browser for the "
"number of days this site sets. And a cookie remembers which way of signing "
"in you used last, so the sign-in page opens on it."
msgstr ""
"mientras entras, unas cookies de corta duración guardan el avance del "
"intento: un acceso social, un cambio de contraseña, la dirección a la que "
"pediste un enlace, la solicitud que estás confirmando al entrar. Si pides "
"que no se te vuelva a pedir el segundo paso en un navegador, una cookie "
"recuerda ese navegador durante los días que fija este sitio. Y una cookie "
"recuerda de qué forma entraste la última vez, para que la página de acceso "
"se abra en esa."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:82
msgid "Delete your account for good?"
msgstr "¿Borrar tu cuenta para siempre?"

#: templates/account/privacy.php:83
msgid "This is the last step, and it cannot be undone."
msgstr "Es el último paso, y no se puede deshacer."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:92
msgid "Yes, delete my account"
msgstr "Sí, borrar mi cuenta"

#: templates/account/privacy.php:93
msgid "No, keep it"
msgstr "No, conservarla"

#: templates/account/privacy.php:95
msgid ""
"Keeping it leaves the request unconfirmed: the link in the e-mail works "
"until it expires."
msgstr ""
"Si la conservas, la solicitud queda sin confirmar: el enlace del correo "
"funciona hasta que venza."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:107
msgid ""
"Confirmed, and your file is ready: download it below. We have e-mailed you "
"as well."
msgstr ""
"Confirmado, y tu archivo está listo: descárgalo aquí abajo. También te "
"enviamos un correo."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:109
msgid "Confirmed. The site takes it from here and lets you know by e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Confirmado. El sitio se encarga a partir de aquí y te avisa por correo."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:111
msgid ""
"That link belongs to another account. Sign out and sign in with the account "
"that asked for it."
msgstr ""
"Ese enlace es de otra cuenta. Cierra sesión y entra con la cuenta que lo "
"pidió."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:113
msgid ""
"That link no longer works: it was already used or it expired. You can ask "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Ese enlace ya no funciona: ya se usó o venció. Puedes volver a solicitarlo."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:175
msgid "Ask to delete your account?"
msgstr "¿Pedir que se borre tu cuenta?"

#: templates/account/privacy.php:176
msgid ""
"We send you an e-mail to confirm it. Once you do, there is no going back."
msgstr ""
"Te enviamos un correo para confirmarlo. Una vez que lo hagas, no hay vuelta "
"atrás."

#: templates/account/privacy.php:179
msgid "Yes, send me the e-mail"
msgstr "Sí, envíame el correo"

#: includes/admin-2fa.php:244
msgid ""
"The second step is off, so nothing below is asked of anybody. What is chosen "
"applies the day it is turned on."
msgstr ""
"La verificación en dos pasos está apagada, así que no se le pide nada de lo "
"de abajo a nadie. Lo que se elija aplica el día que se encienda."

#: includes/admin-2fa.php:294
msgid ""
"The e-mail link is not one of the ways in on this site, so nobody follows "
"one. What is chosen here applies the day it is."
msgstr ""
"El enlace por correo no es una de las formas de entrar en este sitio, así "
"que nadie sigue uno. Lo que se elija aquí aplica el día que lo sea."

#: includes/admin-2fa.php:296 includes/admin-login.php:441
msgid "Ways in →"
msgstr "Formas de entrar →"

#: includes/admin-account.php:1136
msgid ""
"The profile is left as WordPress ships it, so nobody is sent anywhere. Who "
"this reaches applies the day it sends people to the site or closes the "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"El perfil queda como lo trae WordPress, así que no se manda a nadie a ningún "
"lado. A quién alcanza aplica el día que mande a la gente al sitio o cierre "
"la pantalla."

#: includes/admin-login.php:439
msgid ""
"Nobody signs in with a password on this site, so wp-login.php has nothing "
"left to offer and everybody is sent to the sign-in page. What is chosen here "
"applies the day a password is a way in again."
msgstr ""
"En este sitio nadie entra con contraseña, así que wp-login.php no tiene nada "
"que ofrecer y todo el mundo va a la página de acceso. Lo que se elija aquí "
"aplica el día que la contraseña vuelva a ser una forma de entrar."

#: includes/admin-login.php:462
msgid "its form only takes a password, and this site takes none"
msgstr ""
"su formulario solo acepta una contraseña, y este sitio no acepta ninguna"

#: includes/admin-login.php:908
msgid ""
"The ways in are stacked on this site, so there are no tabs and none opens "
"first. What is chosen here applies the day they are in tabs."
msgstr ""
"En este sitio las formas de entrar van apiladas, así que no hay pestañas y "
"ninguna se abre primero. Lo que se elija aquí aplica el día que vayan en "
"pestañas."

#: includes/admin-register.php:239
msgid "the e-mail link is not one of the ways in, so nobody gets one"
msgstr ""
"el enlace por correo no es una de las formas de entrar, así que nadie recibe "
"uno"

#: includes/admin-register.php:251
msgid "social sign-in is not one of the ways in"
msgstr "el acceso con redes sociales no es una de las formas de entrar"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:34 includes/admin-ui.php:269
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Guardar los cambios"

#: includes/admin-ui.php:325
msgid "Nothing changed yet"
msgstr "Sin cambios todavía"

#: includes/admin-ui.php:326
msgid "There are unsaved changes"
msgstr "Hay cambios sin guardar"

#. translators: %s: number of rows deleted
#: includes/admin-log.php:195
#, php-format
msgid "The activity log was emptied: %s rows deleted."
msgstr "Se vació el registro de actividad: se borraron %s filas."

#: includes/admin-log.php:207
msgid "Empty it now"
msgstr "Vaciarlo ahora"

#: includes/admin-log.php:202
msgid ""
"Every row goes, whatever its age, and the Activity tab starts again from "
"nothing. What is recorded from then on follows the settings above."
msgstr ""
"Se van todas las filas, tengan la edad que tengan, y la pestaña Actividad "
"arranca de cero. Lo que se registre desde entonces sigue los ajustes de "
"arriba."

#. translators: %s: number of rows
#: includes/admin-log.php:224
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The %s rows of the activity log are deleted for good. It cannot be undone. "
"Go ahead?"
msgstr ""
"Las %s filas del registro de actividad se borran para siempre. No se puede "
"deshacer. ¿Seguimos?"

#: includes/admin-log.php:228
msgid "Delete every row"
msgstr "Borrar todas las filas"

#: includes/admin-log.php:231
msgid "There is nothing in it."
msgstr "No hay nada."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:182
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The “Continue with %s” button disappears from the sign-in page, and whoever "
"signed in that way will have to use another way in. The app’s details stay "
"saved, and turning it on again brings the button back."
msgstr ""
"El botón «Continuar con %s» desaparece de la página de acceso, y quien "
"entraba así va a tener que usar otra forma de entrar. Los datos de la app "
"quedan guardados, y al activarlo de nuevo el botón vuelve."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:195
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The client ID, the secret and the test of %s are deleted and its button "
"disappears. Using it again means pasting them and testing it again. Accounts "
"already linked to it are not touched."
msgstr ""
"Se borran el ID de cliente, el secreto y la prueba de %s, y su botón "
"desaparece. Para volver a usarlo hay que pegarlos y probarlo otra vez. Las "
"cuentas ya vinculadas no se tocan."

#: includes/admin-social.php:872
msgid "Delete its settings"
msgstr "Eliminar su configuración"

#: includes/admin-ui.php:327
msgid ""
"There are changes on this screen that have not been saved. If you leave now, "
"they are lost."
msgstr ""
"Hay cambios en esta pantalla que no se guardaron. Si te vas ahora, se "
"pierden."

#: includes/admin-ui.php:343
msgid "Discard the changes"
msgstr "Descartar los cambios"

#: includes/admin-social.php:249 includes/admin-social.php:861
msgctxt "a sign-in provider"
msgid "Turn it off"
msgstr "Desactivar"

#: includes/admin-social.php:250 includes/admin-social.php:865
msgctxt "a sign-in provider"
msgid "Turn it on"
msgstr "Activar"

#: includes/admin-log.php:203
msgid ""
"Every row of this site goes, whatever its age, and this tab starts again "
"from nothing. What is recorded from then on follows the network’s log "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Se van todas las filas de este sitio, tengan la antigüedad que tengan, y "
"esta pestaña vuelve a empezar de cero. Lo que se registre a partir de "
"entonces sigue los ajustes del registro de la red."

#: includes/admin-log.php:316
msgid "Nothing is being recorded on any site of the network."
msgstr "No se está registrando nada en ningún sitio de la red."

#: includes/admin-log.php:780
msgid "Network Admin › Activity log"
msgstr "Administración de la red › Registro de actividad"

#: includes/admin-login.php:717
msgid ""
"On this network these are switched on or off for every site at once, in "
"Network Admin: social accounts under Social login › Rules, passkeys under "
"Security › Passkeys."
msgstr ""
"En esta red se activan o desactivan para todos los sitios a la vez, en "
"Administración de la red: las cuentas sociales en Login social › Reglas, las "
"passkeys en Seguridad › Passkeys."

#: includes/admin-network.php:277
msgid "The network"
msgstr "La red"

#: includes/admin-network.php:288
msgid "Deleting the plugin"
msgstr "Borrar el plugin"

#: includes/admin-network.php:315
msgid ""
"On this network the plugin applies one set of rules to every site. Who gets "
"in and how safely, the social sign-in apps, the fields a person has and what "
"the activity log keeps are decided here, for all of them. Each site keeps "
"its own menus, admin bar, reports and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"En esta red el plugin aplica un solo conjunto de reglas a todos los sitios. "
"Quién entra y con cuánta seguridad, las apps de acceso social, los campos "
"que tiene una persona y lo que guarda el registro de actividad se deciden "
"aquí, para todos. Cada sitio conserva sus propios menús, barra de "
"administración, informes y mantenimiento."

#: includes/admin-network.php:332
msgid "Where the accounts live"
msgstr "Dónde viven las cuentas"

#: includes/admin-network.php:334
msgid ""
"The main site of the network. Its sign-in, registration and account pages, "
"and how they look, are set on its own dashboard."
msgstr ""
"El sitio principal de la red. Sus páginas de acceso, registro y cuenta, y "
"cómo se ven, se configuran en su propio escritorio."

#: includes/admin-network.php:338
msgid "Open its dashboard"
msgstr "Abrir su escritorio"

#: includes/admin-network.php:347
msgid "How the sites are addressed"
msgstr "Cómo se direccionan los sitios"

#: includes/admin-network.php:348
msgid "Subdomains"
msgstr "Subdominios"

#: includes/admin-network.php:348
msgid "Subdirectories"
msgstr "Subdirectorios"

#. translators: %s: number of sites
#: includes/admin-network.php:351
#, php-format
msgid "%s site on this network."
msgid_plural "%s sites on this network."
msgstr[0] "%s sitio en esta red."
msgstr[1] "%s sitios en esta red."

#. translators: %s: the addresses of the sites, each in <code>
#: includes/admin-network.php:372
#, php-format
msgid "These sites have a domain of their own: %s."
msgstr "Estos sitios tienen un dominio propio: %s."

#: includes/admin-network.php:375
msgid ""
"People have to sign in again on these sites: a session opened on the rest of "
"the network does not reach a domain of its own. That is not supported in "
"this version."
msgstr ""
"En estos sitios la gente tiene que volver a entrar: una sesión abierta en el "
"resto de la red no llega a un dominio propio. Eso no está soportado en esta "
"versión."

#: includes/admin-network.php:386
msgid "What a site can no longer change"
msgstr "Lo que un sitio ya no puede cambiar"

#: includes/admin-network.php:388
msgid ""
"The second step, passkeys, how long a session lasts, the proxy, the social "
"sign-in apps and their rules, the fields a person has and what the log "
"keeps. A site administrator does not see these screens, and nothing sent to "
"their own site writes them."
msgstr ""
"El segundo paso, las passkeys, cuánto dura una sesión, el proxy, las apps de "
"acceso social y sus reglas, los campos que tiene una persona y lo que guarda "
"el registro. Un administrador del sitio no ve estas pantallas, y nada que se "
"envíe a su propio sitio las escribe."

#: includes/admin-network.php:389
msgid ""
"What fits into each site’s theme is still that site’s: where the account "
"link goes in its menus, its admin bar and its dashboard profile."
msgstr ""
"Lo que encaja en el tema de cada sitio sigue siendo de ese sitio: dónde va "
"el enlace a la cuenta en sus menús, su barra de administración y el perfil "
"de su escritorio."

#: includes/admin-network.php:404
msgid "Set for the whole network"
msgstr "Configurado para toda la red"

#: includes/admin-network.php:424
msgid "What the sites had set differently"
msgstr "Lo que los sitios tenían configurado distinto"

#: includes/admin-network.php:425
msgid ""
"When the settings became the network’s, the main site’s were kept. These "
"sites had something else, and now follow the network. The user fields are "
"the exception: every site’s fields were kept."
msgstr ""
"Cuando los ajustes pasaron a ser de la red, se conservaron los del sitio "
"principal. Estos sitios tenían otra cosa, y ahora siguen a la red. Los "
"campos de usuario son la excepción: se conservaron los campos de cada sitio."

#: includes/admin-log.php:594 includes/admin-log.php:686
#: includes/admin-network.php:431 includes/log-privacy.php:97
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Sitio"

#: includes/admin-network.php:432
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Ajuste"

#: includes/admin-network.php:433
msgid "What it had"
msgstr "Lo que tenía"

#: includes/admin-network.php:457
msgid ""
"Different credentials, not shown. The main site’s are the network’s now."
msgstr ""
"Otras credenciales, que no se muestran. Ahora las de la red son las del "
"sitio principal."

#: includes/admin-network.php:459
msgid ""
"Everything was to go when the plugin is deleted. The network’s answer starts "
"unticked: it is decided on the Deleting the plugin tab."
msgstr ""
"Todo se iba a borrar al borrar el plugin. La respuesta de la red empieza sin "
"marcar: se decide en la pestaña Borrar el plugin."

#. translators: %s: the key of a user field
#: includes/admin-network.php:463
#, php-format
msgid "A different definition of the field %s. The main site’s was kept."
msgstr ""
"Una definición distinta del campo %s. Se conservó la del sitio principal."

#. translators: 1: plugin name, 2: the names of the sites, comma separated
#: includes/admin-network.php:496
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s now applies one set of settings to the whole network, taken from the "
"main site. These sites had set some of them differently: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"%1$s ahora aplica un solo conjunto de ajustes a toda la red, tomado del "
"sitio principal. Estos sitios tenían algunos configurados distinto: %2$s."

#: includes/admin-network.php:502
msgid "See what was different"
msgstr "Ver qué era distinto"

#: includes/admin-network.php:504
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Descartar"

#: includes/admin-network.php:543
msgid ""
"By default, deleting the plugin removes nothing. The settings stay, every "
"site’s activity log stays, and so does everything in people’s profiles — "
"their details, their public names, their passkeys and their second factors. "
"A plugin deleted by accident, or deleted to be installed again, should not "
"be what loses somebody their account."
msgstr ""
"Por omisión, borrar el plugin no elimina nada. Quedan los ajustes, queda el "
"registro de actividad de cada sitio y queda todo lo que hay en los perfiles: "
"los datos de cada persona, sus nombres públicos, sus passkeys y sus segundos "
"factores. Un plugin borrado por error, o borrado para volver a instalarlo, "
"no tiene que ser lo que le haga perder la cuenta a alguien."

#: includes/admin-network.php:553
msgid ""
"The network’s settings, every site’s settings and activity log, and what the "
"plugin keeps in people’s profiles. It cannot be undone, and it runs on "
"delete, not on deactivate."
msgstr ""
"Los ajustes de la red, los ajustes y el registro de actividad de cada sitio, "
"y lo que el plugin guarda en los perfiles. No se puede deshacer, y se "
"ejecuta al borrar, no al desactivar."

#: includes/admin-network.php:562
msgid "Deleting the plugin removes everything it wrote, on every site."
msgstr "Borrar el plugin elimina todo lo que escribió, en todos los sitios."

#: includes/admin-network.php:563
msgid "Deleting the plugin leaves the data where it is."
msgstr "Borrar el plugin deja los datos donde están."

#: includes/admin-network.php:611
msgid "Set somewhere else"
msgstr "Se configura en otro lugar"

#: includes/admin-network.php:613
msgid ""
"On this network the rules about people are the network’s, and the screens "
"people sign in and keep their account on are the main site’s. This site "
"keeps its own menus, admin bar, reports and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"En esta red las reglas sobre las personas son de la red, y las pantallas "
"donde la gente entra y mantiene su cuenta son las del sitio principal. Este "
"sitio conserva sus propios menús, barra de administración, informes y "
"mantenimiento."

#: includes/admin-network.php:614
msgid ""
"On this network the rules about people are the network’s: they apply to "
"every site, and they are set in Network Admin."
msgstr ""
"En esta red las reglas sobre las personas son de la red: valen para todos "
"los sitios y se configuran en Administración de la red."

#: includes/admin-network.php:626
msgid "Open it"
msgstr "Abrir"

#: includes/admin-network.php:635
msgid ""
"Managed by the network: one setting for every site, set in Network Admin."
msgstr ""
"Lo gestiona la red: un solo ajuste para todos los sitios, configurado en "
"Administración de la red."

#. translators: %s: the name of the network's main site
#: includes/admin-network.php:638
#, php-format
msgid "Set on %s, the site where people sign in and keep their account."
msgstr ""
"Se configura en %s, el sitio donde la gente entra y mantiene su cuenta."

#: includes/admin-passkeys.php:81 includes/admin-passkeys.php:155
#: includes/admin-social.php:443
msgid "Offered on every site"
msgstr "Se ofrecen en todos los sitios"

#: includes/admin-passkeys.php:90
msgid "People can add a passkey and sign in with it"
msgstr "La gente puede añadir una passkey y entrar con ella"

#: includes/admin-social.php:452
msgid "People can sign in with a social account"
msgstr "La gente puede entrar con una cuenta social"

#: includes/admin-social.php:453
msgid ""
"The buttons under the sign-in form of every site, for the providers that are "
"working. Off, they go, and whoever already linked a social account keeps it "
"and can unlink it from their account."
msgstr ""
"Los botones debajo del formulario de acceso de cada sitio, para las redes "
"que están funcionando. Apagados, se van, y quien ya vinculó una cuenta "
"social la conserva y puede desvincularla desde su cuenta."

#: includes/admin-tools.php:623
msgid ""
"Decided for the whole network: deleting the plugin removes everything it "
"wrote, on every site."
msgstr ""
"Decidido para toda la red: borrar el plugin elimina todo lo que escribió, en "
"todos los sitios."

#: includes/admin-tools.php:624
msgid ""
"Decided for the whole network: deleting the plugin leaves the data where it "
"is."
msgstr ""
"Decidido para toda la red: borrar el plugin deja los datos donde están."

#: includes/admin-log.php:104
msgid ""
"What every site of the network writes down about what people do, and how "
"long it keeps it. The rows are one table for the whole network: each site "
"sees its own on its Reports › Activity, and the Activity tab beside this one "
"has them all. A group that is not ticked here is not recorded on any site."
msgstr ""
"Lo que cada sitio de la red anota sobre lo que hace la gente, y cuánto "
"tiempo lo guarda. Las filas son una sola tabla para toda la red: cada sitio "
"ve las suyas en su Informes › Actividad, y la pestaña Actividad, junto a "
"esta, las tiene todas. Un grupo que no está marcado aquí no se registra en "
"ningún sitio."

#: includes/admin-log.php:204
msgid ""
"Every row of every site goes, whatever its age, and every site’s Activity "
"tab starts again from nothing. What is recorded from then on follows the log "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Se van todas las filas de todos los sitios, tengan la antigüedad que tengan, "
"y la pestaña Actividad de cada sitio vuelve a empezar de cero. Lo que se "
"registre a partir de entonces sigue los ajustes del registro."

#. translators: %s: number of rows
#: includes/admin-log.php:219
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The %s rows of every site’s activity log are deleted for good. It cannot be "
"undone. Go ahead?"
msgstr ""
"Las %s filas del registro de actividad de todos los sitios se borran para "
"siempre. No se puede deshacer. ¿Seguimos?"

#. translators: 1: number of rows, 2: size on disk, e.g. "4 MB".
#: includes/admin-log.php:292
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site has %1$s rows in the network’s table, which takes %2$s for every "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio tiene %1$s filas en la tabla de la red, que ocupa %2$s para todos "
"los sitios."

#. translators: %s: the groups being recorded, each in <code>.
#: includes/admin-log.php:319
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Every site of the network records %s and nothing else, in one table for the "
"whole network."
msgstr ""
"Cada sitio de la red registra %s y nada más, en una sola tabla para toda la "
"red."

#: includes/admin-log.php:577
msgid ""
"What happened on every site of the network, newest first, with the site each "
"row happened on. It shows only what was being recorded at the time: a group "
"ticked this morning has nothing in it from yesterday."
msgstr ""
"Qué pasó en cada sitio de la red, lo más nuevo primero, con el sitio donde "
"pasó cada fila. Muestra solo lo que se estaba registrando en ese momento: un "
"grupo marcado esta mañana no tiene nada de ayer."

#: includes/admin-log.php:596
msgid "Site ID"
msgstr "ID del sitio"

#: includes/admin-log.php:599 includes/admin-membership.php:123
msgid "Every site"
msgstr "Todos los sitios"

#: includes/admin-log.php:805
msgid ""
"The sites’ older rows are still being moved into the network’s table, a "
"batch every minute. Until that finishes, some sites show only their newer "
"rows."
msgstr ""
"Las filas más antiguas de los sitios todavía se están pasando a la tabla de "
"la red, un lote por minuto. Hasta que termine, algunos sitios muestran solo "
"sus filas más recientes."

#: includes/admin-log.php:806
msgid ""
"This site’s older rows are still being moved into the network’s table, a "
"batch every minute. Until that finishes, some of them may not be here yet."
msgstr ""
"Las filas más antiguas de este sitio todavía se están pasando a la tabla de "
"la red, un lote por minuto. Hasta que termine, puede que algunas aún no "
"estén aquí."

#. translators: %d: the id of a site that no longer exists.
#: includes/log.php:445
#, php-format
msgid "Site %d"
msgstr "Sitio %d"

#: includes/network-gate.php:111
msgid ""
"DiluxOne Users+ only works on a network when it is activated for the whole "
"network. It is on for this site alone, so it does nothing here: no screens, "
"no sign-in, no account area."
msgstr ""
"DiluxOne Users+ solo funciona en una red si está activado para toda la red. "
"Aquí está activado solo para este sitio, así que no hace nada: ni pantallas, "
"ni inicio de sesión, ni área de cuenta."

#: includes/network-gate.php:113
msgid "Activate DiluxOne Users+ for the whole network"
msgstr "Activar DiluxOne Users+ para toda la red"

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: includes/auth-passkeys.php:454
#, php-format
msgid "Passkeys are used on %s, where your account is."
msgstr "Las llaves de acceso se usan en %s, donde está tu cuenta."

#. translators: 1: this site's domain, 2: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: includes/network-hub.php:895
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site is on a domain of its own (%1$s). People must sign in again on "
"this site: signing in on %2$s does not carry over to it. A domain of its own "
"is not supported by DiluxOne Users+ in this version."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio tiene un dominio propio (%1$s). Aquí hay que volver a iniciar "
"sesión: entrar en %2$s no se traslada a este sitio. DiluxOne Users+ no "
"admite dominios propios en esta versión."

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: templates/hub-door.php:22
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You sign in on %s, where your account is. You come back here afterwards."
msgstr "Inicias sesión en %s, donde está tu cuenta. Después regresas aquí."

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: templates/hub-door.php:28
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Accounts are created on %s, for every site of the network. You come back "
"here afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas se crean en %s, para todos los sitios de la red. Después "
"regresas aquí."

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: templates/hub-door.php:34
#, php-format
msgid "Your account is kept on %s, for every site of the network."
msgstr "Tu cuenta está en %s, para todos los sitios de la red."

#: templates/hub-door.php:35
msgid "Open your account"
msgstr "Abre tu cuenta"

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the person signed in
#: includes/admin-log.php:421
#, php-format
msgid "on %s"
msgstr "en %s"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:27 includes/admin-membership.php:43
#: includes/admin.php:79
msgid "Membership"
msgstr "Membresía"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:61
msgid "That is not one of the three answers. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Esa no es una de las tres respuestas. No se guardó nada."

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: includes/admin-membership.php:126
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Every account is a member of every live site of the network. A new account "
"joins every site, a new site gets every account, and signing in adds "
"whatever is missing. The role is each site’s own New User Default Role; on "
"%s, the role new accounts get."
msgstr ""
"Cada cuenta es miembro de todos los sitios activos de la red. Una cuenta "
"nueva se une a todos los sitios, un sitio nuevo recibe todas las cuentas, e "
"iniciar sesión agrega lo que falte. El rol es el perfil predeterminado para "
"usuarios nuevos de cada sitio; en %s, el rol que reciben las cuentas nuevas."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:129
msgid "Every account is a member of every live site of the network."
msgstr "Cada cuenta es miembro de todos los sitios activos de la red."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:132
msgid "Whoever asks"
msgstr "Quien lo pida"

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: includes/admin-membership.php:135
#, php-format
msgid ""
"An account is a member of %s, where it lives. On any other site, somebody "
"signed in who is not a member is offered “Join this site”, and joins with "
"that site’s New User Default Role."
msgstr ""
"Una cuenta es miembro de %s, donde vive. En cualquier otro sitio, a quien "
"haya iniciado sesión sin ser miembro se le ofrece «Unirse a este sitio», y "
"se une con el perfil predeterminado para usuarios nuevos de ese sitio."

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: includes/admin-membership.php:140
#, php-format
msgid "Accounts are members of %s, and join any other site with a click."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas son miembros de %s y se unen a cualquier otro sitio con un clic."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:145
msgid "By invitation"
msgstr "Por invitación"

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: includes/admin-membership.php:148
#, php-format
msgid ""
"An account is a member of %s, where it lives. Only a site’s administrators "
"add people to it; somebody signed in who is not a member is told the site is "
"by invitation."
msgstr ""
"Una cuenta es miembro de %s, donde vive. Solo los administradores de un "
"sitio agregan gente a él; a quien haya iniciado sesión sin ser miembro se le "
"dice que el sitio es por invitación."

#. translators: %s: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: includes/admin-membership.php:153
#, php-format
msgid "Accounts are members of %s; administrators add them to any other site."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas son miembros de %s; los administradores las agregan a cualquier "
"otro sitio."

#. translators: %s: the e-mail address of a new account
#: includes/admin-membership.php:172
#, php-format
msgid "A new account, %s, on every site"
msgstr "Una cuenta nueva, %s, en todos los sitios"

#. translators: %s: the name of a new site
#: includes/admin-membership.php:178
#, php-format
msgid "Every account on a new site, %s"
msgstr "Todas las cuentas en un sitio nuevo, %s"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:182
msgid "Everybody on every site"
msgstr "Todos en todos los sitios"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:196
msgid "Everybody is a member of every live site now."
msgstr "Ahora todos son miembros de todos los sitios activos."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:198
msgid ""
"Adding everybody to every site has started. It goes on in the background, a "
"batch at a time; its progress is below."
msgstr ""
"Se empezó a agregar a todos en todos los sitios. Sigue en segundo plano, por "
"tandas; su progreso está más abajo."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:203
msgid ""
"An account belongs to the whole network; being a member of a site — having a "
"role on it — is each site’s. This decides which sites an account is a member "
"of, for every site of the network."
msgstr ""
"Una cuenta pertenece a toda la red; ser miembro de un sitio —tener un rol en "
"él— es cosa de cada sitio. Esto decide de qué sitios es miembro una cuenta, "
"para todos los sitios de la red."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:205
msgid "Who is a member of which site"
msgstr "Quién es miembro de qué sitio"

#. translators: %s: number of sites
#: includes/admin-membership.php:246
#, php-format
msgid "%s live site."
msgid_plural "%s live sites."
msgstr[0] "%s sitio activo."
msgstr[1] "%s sitios activos."

#. translators: %s: number of jobs
#: includes/admin-membership.php:256
#, php-format
msgid "%s job is adding people in the background."
msgid_plural "%s jobs are adding people in the background."
msgstr[0] "%s tarea está agregando gente en segundo plano."
msgstr[1] "%s tareas están agregando gente en segundo plano."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:267
msgid "A removal is a decision"
msgstr "Una baja es una decisión"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:269
msgid ""
"Somebody an administrator removes from a site is not added back to it by any "
"of this — not by the policy, not by signing in, not by “Join this site” — "
"until an administrator adds them again."
msgstr ""
"A quien un administrador quita de un sitio, nada de esto lo vuelve a agregar "
"—ni la política, ni iniciar sesión, ni «Unirse a este sitio»— hasta que un "
"administrador lo agregue de nuevo."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:270
msgid ""
"Super admins reach every site already and are never added. Archived, spam "
"and deleted sites get nobody."
msgstr ""
"Los superadministradores ya llegan a todos los sitios y nunca se agregan. "
"Los sitios archivados, marcados como spam o eliminados no reciben a nadie."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:275
msgid "Where the members are"
msgstr "Dónde están los miembros"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:279
msgid "Network Admin › Users"
msgstr "Administración de la red › Usuarios"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:280
msgid "Every account, and the sites each one is a member of."
msgstr "Todas las cuentas, y los sitios de los que es miembro cada una."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:284
msgid "Network Admin › Sites"
msgstr "Administración de la red › Sitios"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:285
msgid "Each site’s own users, and its New User Default Role under Settings."
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios de cada sitio, y su perfil predeterminado para usuarios nuevos "
"en Configuración."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:309
msgid "The accounts and sites already there"
msgstr "Las cuentas y los sitios que ya estaban"

#. translators: 1: percentage done, 2: additions looked at, 3: additions in all
#: includes/admin-membership.php:324
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s%% (%2$s of %3$s)"
msgstr "%1$s%% (%2$s de %3$s)"

#. translators: 1: number of accounts, 2: number of sites
#: includes/admin-membership.php:342
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Every one of the %1$s accounts becomes a member of every one of the %2$s "
"live sites it is not a member of yet, except where an administrator removed "
"it. Go ahead?"
msgstr ""
"Cada una de las %1$s cuentas pasa a ser miembro de cada uno de los %2$s "
"sitios activos de los que aún no lo es, salvo donde un administrador la "
"quitó. ¿Seguimos?"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:347
msgid "Sync everyone now"
msgstr "Sincronizar a todos ahora"

#: includes/site-menu.php:130 templates/join.php:25 templates/join.php:49
msgid "Join this site"
msgstr "Unirse a este sitio"

#: includes/site-menu.php:137 templates/join.php:30
msgid "This site is by invitation"
msgstr "Este sitio es por invitación"

#. translators: 1: the name of this site, 2: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: templates/join.php:27
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You are signed in with your account from %2$s, and you are not a member of "
"%1$s yet. Join it to take part here."
msgstr ""
"Iniciaste sesión con tu cuenta de %2$s y todavía no eres miembro de %1$s. "
"Únete para participar aquí."

#. translators: 1: the name of this site, 2: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: templates/join.php:32
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You are signed in with your account from %2$s, and you are not a member of "
"%1$s. Only its administrators add people to it."
msgstr ""
"Iniciaste sesión con tu cuenta de %2$s y no eres miembro de %1$s. Solo sus "
"administradores agregan gente."

#: templates/join.php:35
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Te damos la bienvenida"

#. translators: 1: the name of this site, 2: the name of the site where the network's accounts live
#: templates/join.php:37
#, php-format
msgid "You are a member of %1$s now, with your account from %2$s."
msgstr "Ahora eres miembro de %1$s, con tu cuenta de %2$s."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:310
msgid ""
"New accounts and new sites follow the policy on their own. What existed "
"before it is added with this. Removals made by an administrator stay."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas y los sitios nuevos siguen la política por sí solos. Lo que "
"existía antes se agrega con esto. Las bajas que hizo un administrador se "
"mantienen."

#: includes/admin-2fa.php:53
msgid ""
"There is no sign-in page, and this site says wp-login.php does not draw the "
"second step, so there is nowhere to type the code: it is not asked of "
"anybody and cannot be required. Choose a sign-in page and it can."
msgstr ""
"No hay página de acceso y este sitio dice que wp-login.php no muestra el "
"segundo paso, así que no hay dónde escribir el código: no se le pide a nadie "
"y no se puede exigir. Elige una página de acceso y se podrá."

#: includes/admin-2fa.php:223
msgid "needs a sign-in page"
msgstr "necesita una página de acceso"

#: includes/admin-2fa.php:249
msgid "The sign-in page →"
msgstr "La página de acceso →"

#: includes/admin-2fa.php:441
msgid "there is nowhere to type the code"
msgstr "no hay dónde escribir el código"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:257
msgid ""
"The fields ticked were added at the end of the list. Each one can be edited, "
"moved or deleted like any other."
msgstr ""
"Los campos marcados se agregaron al final de la lista. Cada uno se puede "
"editar, mover o borrar como cualquier otro."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:258
msgid ""
"Nothing was added: no suggested field was ticked, or the ones ticked were "
"already on the list."
msgstr ""
"No se agregó nada: no se marcó ningún campo sugerido, o los marcados ya "
"estaban en la lista."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:291
msgid "Suggested fields"
msgstr "Campos sugeridos"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:392 includes/admin-fields.php:569
msgid "Add suggested fields"
msgstr "Agregar campos sugeridos"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:567
msgid ""
"A few questions many sites ask the people who register. None of them is "
"asked until it is added here: tick the ones this site needs and they join "
"the list, where each can be edited, made required, moved or deleted like any "
"other field."
msgstr ""
"Algunas preguntas que muchos sitios hacen a quien se registra. Ninguna se "
"pregunta hasta que se agrega aquí: marca las que este sitio necesita y pasan "
"a la lista, donde cada una se puede editar, hacer obligatoria, mover o "
"borrar como cualquier otro campo."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:573
msgid "Every suggested field is already on the list."
msgstr "Todos los campos sugeridos ya están en la lista."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:575
msgid "The fields →"
msgstr "Los campos →"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:597
msgid "Add the ones ticked"
msgstr "Agregar los marcados"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:604
msgid "Every suggested field is on the list."
msgstr "Todos los campos sugeridos están en la lista."

#. translators: %s: how many suggested fields are not on the list
#: includes/admin-fields.php:608
#, php-format
msgid "%s suggested field is not on the list."
msgid_plural "%s suggested fields are not on the list."
msgstr[0] "%s campo sugerido no está en la lista."
msgstr[1] "%s campos sugeridos no están en la lista."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:616
msgid "Why they are not there from the start"
msgstr "Por qué no están desde el principio"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:618
msgid ""
"Asking for somebody’s birthday, gender or phone is a decision about their "
"data, and it is the site’s to make — not something a plugin should do on the "
"day it is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Pedir a alguien su cumpleaños, su género o su teléfono es una decisión sobre "
"sus datos, y le corresponde al sitio tomarla — no es algo que un plugin deba "
"hacer el día que se activa."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:619
msgid ""
"A field deleted later keeps the answers already given, the same as any other."
msgstr ""
"Un campo que se borra después conserva las respuestas ya dadas, igual que "
"cualquier otro."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:35
msgid "Confirm the policy"
msgstr "Confirmar la política"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:80
msgid ""
"The policy is confirmed, and everybody is a member of every live site now."
msgstr ""
"La política está confirmada y ahora todos son miembros de todos los sitios "
"activos."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:82
msgid ""
"The policy is confirmed. Adding everybody to every site has started; it goes "
"on in the background, a batch at a time, and its progress is below."
msgstr ""
"La política está confirmada. Empezó a agregarse a todos en todos los sitios; "
"sigue en segundo plano, por tandas, y el avance está abajo."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:106
msgid ""
"DiluxOne Users+: the network’s membership policy has not been confirmed, so "
"nobody is added to any site by it yet and WordPress’s own memberships stand. "
"Choose who is a member of which site and confirm it."
msgstr ""
"DiluxOne Users+: la política de membresía de la red no se ha confirmado, así "
"que todavía no agrega a nadie a ningún sitio y valen las membresías propias "
"de WordPress. Elige quién es miembro de qué sitio y confírmalo."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:108
msgid "Network Admin › Membership →"
msgstr "Administración de la red › Membresía →"

#: includes/admin-membership.php:225
msgid ""
"Not confirmed yet: until it is, none of this happens and WordPress’s own "
"memberships stand. The button beside confirms the answer that is ticked; "
"under “Every site”, confirming it adds every account to every live site."
msgstr ""
"Aún sin confirmar: hasta que se confirme, nada de esto pasa y valen las "
"membresías propias de WordPress. El botón de al lado confirma la respuesta "
"marcada; con “Todos los sitios”, confirmarla agrega cada cuenta a cada sitio "
"activo."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:234
msgid ""
"The policy is waiting to be confirmed: nobody is added to any site by it yet."
msgstr ""
"La política espera confirmación: todavía no agrega a nadie a ningún sitio."

#: includes/admin-membership.php:236
msgid "not confirmed"
msgstr "sin confirmar"

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:153
msgid ""
"Left at 0, WordPress decides: 2 days, or 14 with “remember me”. On a site "
"people come into by e-mail link that is the inbox again every other day, so "
"a number here sets a length of the site’s own."
msgstr ""
"En 0 decide WordPress: 2 días, o 14 con “recordarme”. En un sitio al que se "
"entra con un enlace por correo, eso es volver a la bandeja de entrada cada "
"dos días, así que un número aquí fija una duración propia del sitio."

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:165
msgid ""
"0 for what WordPress decides, 14 days. The sign-in link always counts as "
"“remember me”: there is no password to type again."
msgstr ""
"0 para lo que decida WordPress, 14 días. El enlace de acceso siempre cuenta "
"como “recordarme”: no hay contraseña que volver a escribir."

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:176
msgid ""
"0 for what WordPress decides, 2 days. What somebody gets when they leave the "
"box unticked on a form that offers it."
msgstr ""
"0 para lo que decida WordPress, 2 días. Lo que recibe alguien que deja la "
"casilla sin marcar en un formulario que la ofrece."

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:433
msgid "what WordPress decides"
msgstr "lo que decida WordPress"

#. translators: %s: a number of days
#: includes/admin-sessions.php:438
#, php-format
msgid "%s day"
msgid_plural "%s days"
msgstr[0] "%s día"
msgstr[1] "%s días"

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:467
msgid ""
"What WordPress decides: 14 days with “remember me”, 2 without. The e-mail "
"link always counts as “remember me”."
msgstr ""
"Lo que decida WordPress: 14 días con “recordarme”, 2 sin. El enlace por "
"correo siempre cuenta como “recordarme”."

#. translators: 1: how long with "remember me" (a number of days, or what WordPress decides), 2: the same without it
#: includes/admin-sessions.php:470
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s with “remember me”, %2$s without. The e-mail link always counts as "
"“remember me”."
msgstr ""
"%1$s con “recordarme”, %2$s sin. El enlace por correo siempre cuenta como "
"“recordarme”."

#: includes/auth-wp-login.php:162
msgid ""
"That attempt ran out of time or of tries. Sign in again and a new code is "
"sent."
msgstr ""
"Ese intento se quedó sin tiempo o sin intentos. Vuelve a entrar y se enviará "
"un código nuevo."

#: includes/safe-mode.php:60
msgid "DiluxOne Users+ is in safe mode."
msgstr "DiluxOne Users+ está en modo seguro."

#. translators: %s: the line in wp-config.php that turns safe mode on
#: includes/safe-mode.php:63
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Nothing redirects, nobody is asked for the second step, and passkeys and "
"social sign-in are off: WordPress’s own wp-login.php is the way in. Once you "
"are back in and the cause is fixed, remove %s from wp-config.php."
msgstr ""
"Nada redirige, a nadie se le pide el segundo paso, y las passkeys y el "
"acceso con redes sociales están desactivados: la forma de entrar es el wp-"
"login.php propio de WordPress. Cuando vuelvas a entrar y la causa esté "
"resuelta, quita %s de wp-config.php."

#: templates/account/security.php:40
msgid "Two-step verification is not available on this site right now."
msgstr ""
"La verificación en dos pasos no está disponible en este sitio por ahora."

#: includes/admin-social.php:505
msgid ""
"The roles ticked can use the buttons. Everybody else uses the site’s other "
"ways in."
msgstr ""
"Los roles marcados pueden usar los botones. Los demás entran por las otras "
"formas que tenga el sitio."

#: includes/admin-tools.php:565
msgid ""
"The buttons for when something went wrong and somebody is waiting on the "
"other side."
msgstr ""
"Los botones para cuando algo salió mal y alguien está esperando del otro "
"lado."

#: includes/admin-tools.php:675
msgid "Everyone on the network, me included"
msgstr "Toda la red, yo incluido"

#: includes/privacy.php:246
msgid "Sites an administrator removed you from"
msgstr "Sitios de los que un administrador te quitó"

#: includes/privacy.php:342
msgid ""
"The list of sites an administrator removed this person from was kept: it is "
"what keeps them from being added back to those sites."
msgstr ""
"Se conservó la lista de sitios de los que un administrador quitó a esta "
"persona: es lo que impide que se le vuelva a agregar a esos sitios."
